LDA #0
BEQ BR1

NOP
 

BR1	LDA #1
BNE BR2

 
NOP
 

BR2	LDA #$80
BMI BR3

 
NOP
 

BR3	LDA #1
BPL BR4

 
NOP
 

BR4	CLV
BVC BR5

 
NOP
 

BR5	BIT BITDATA
BVS BR6

 
NOP
 

BR6	CLC
BCC BR7

 
NOP
 

BR7	SEC
BCS BR8

 
NOP
 

BR8	NOP

